{"slug": "S02E01", "video_name": "Community - S02E01 - Anthropology 101 Bluray-1080p Proper.mkv", "subtitle_name": "Community - S02E01 - Anthropology 101 Bluray-1080p Proper.en.hi.srt", "duration_seconds": 1269.925, "language": "en", "stt_provider": "groq", "stt_model": "whisper-large-v3", "segment_count": 479, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 4.8342857142857145, "text": "And we're"}, {"start": 4.8342857142857145, "end": 7.52, "text": "back."}, {"start": 30.0, "end": 33.42927835051547, "text": "She got my number, though I can't stand her."}, {"start": 33.42927835051547, "end": 37.56, "text": "I can't help thinking her, I hope I catch her wonder."}, {"start": 38.04, "end": 41.44, "text": "I know it's clear, you want me dear."}, {"start": 41.96, "end": 47.399998, "text": "Welcome students, new and old, to another fall semester at Greendale."}, {"start": 48.0, "end": 50.78, "text": "It's time for clean slates and fresh starts."}, {"start": 51.739998, "end": 56.18, "text": "Celebrate your fresh start tonight at the Fresh Start Dance in the cafeteria."}, {"start": 56.18, "end": 61.1, "text": "the same cafeteria where Britta Perry publicly professed her love to Jeff Winger"}, {"start": 61.1, "end": 62.7, "text": "who then walked out on her"}, {"start": 62.7, "end": 63.8, "text": "unforgettable"}, {"start": 63.8, "end": 67.48, "text": "plus free punch and fresh start cookies tonight"}, {"start": 67.48, "end": 69.88, "text": "at the Fresh Start Dance"}, {"start": 69.88, "end": 70.74, "text": "look at us"}, {"start": 70.74, "end": 71.86, "text": "living together"}, {"start": 71.86, "end": 73.02, "text": "driving to school together"}, {"start": 73.02, "end": 74.82, "text": "I know we're like Batman and Shaft"}, {"start": 74.82, "end": 77.42, "text": "Batman actually had a guy"}, {"start": 77.42, "end": 78.32, "text": "his name was Robin"}, {"start": 78.32, "end": 80.12, "text": "he rode around with him"}, {"start": 80.12, "end": 80.56, "text": "Troy"}, {"start": 80.56, "end": 82.72, "text": "Batman's friend didn't have to be Robin"}, {"start": 82.72, "end": 83.62, "text": "it could have been Shaft"}, {"start": 83.62, "end": 84.48, "text": "Dolomite"}, {"start": 84.48, "end": 86.02, "text": "Leroy Brown"}, {"start": 86.02, "end": 89.14, "text": "Don't let society limit your people."}, {"start": 90.96, "end": 92.60799999999999, "text": "Batman in shaft."}, {"start": 92.60799999999999, "end": 93.02, "text": "Wow."}, {"start": 93.299995, "end": 95.35999, "text": "You're reading Troy's Twitter page where he posts everything Pierce says?"}, {"start": 95.52, "end": 96.68249999999999, "text": "Yeah, old white man says."}, {"start": 96.68249999999999, "end": 97.38, "text": "It's hilarious."}, {"start": 100.56, "end": 101.939995, "text": "I love it, man."}, {"start": 102.42, "end": 103.02, "text": "I like your hair."}, {"start": 103.079994, "end": 103.67999, "text": "Oh, thank you."}, {"start": 103.67999, "end": 104.0, "text": "You're welcome."}, {"start": 104.88, "end": 106.21999, "text": "Jeffrey, hello."}, {"start": 106.52, "end": 107.759995, "text": "Hey, how was your summer?"}, {"start": 108.17999, "end": 108.799995, "text": "Live with you."}, {"start": 108.799995, "end": 109.38, "text": "How was your summer?"}, {"start": 109.38, "end": 109.57999749999999, "text": "Great."}, {"start": 109.57999749999999, "end": 110.17999, "text": "How are you doing?"}, {"start": 110.32, "end": 111.21999, "text": "I'm so pleased."}, {"start": 111.759995, "end": 112.579994, "text": "Oh, okay."}, {"start": 114.6, "end": 115.619995, "text": "He's going to be back here."}, {"start": 116.02, "end": 122.0, "text": "So, you guys ready for whatever anthropology is?"}, {"start": 122.14, "end": 122.799995, "text": "We should wait for Britta."}, {"start": 123.35999, "end": 125.03999, "text": "Do we know she's coming back?"}, {"start": 125.1, "end": 126.85999, "text": "She never returned any of my calls or emails."}, {"start": 127.399994, "end": 127.82, "text": "Me neither."}, {"start": 129.28, "end": 130.5, "text": "It's not going to be the same without her."}, {"start": 134.752, "end": 136.13199, "text": "Hey, did you guys see Toy Story 3?"}, {"start": 136.292, "end": 136.532, "text": "Yeah!"}, {"start": 136.91199, "end": 137.812, "text": "Oh, my God!"}, {"start": 139.972, "end": 140.452, "text": "Hey!"}, {"start": 140.71200000000002, "end": 140.91199, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 142.292, "end": 142.732, "text": "Hey!"}, {"start": 142.732, "end": 143.732, "text": "Hey, Toy Story 3!"}, {"start": 143.732, "end": 144.43200000000002, "text": "How you doing?"}, {"start": 144.752, "end": 145.352, "text": "How's it going?"}, {"start": 145.972, "end": 149.65852883248732, "text": "Okay yeah yeah yeah I made an ass of myself and Jeff at that dance"}, {"start": 149.65852883248732, "end": 153.23334467005077, "text": "I was just caught up in a competition with his turd of an ex and"}, {"start": 153.23334467005077, "end": 156.97573, "text": "I wish I could have raced the entire night and I owe you an apology"}, {"start": 157.73572000000001, "end": 158.35573000000002, "text": "I accept."}, {"start": 158.55573, "end": 162.05573, "text": "Oh, sweetie, you don't owe us anything, and you don't have to hide from us."}, {"start": 162.17572, "end": 162.4445216, "text": "You?"}, {"start": 162.4445216, "end": 163.85573000000002, "text": "I'm hiding from them."}, {"start": 164.25573, "end": 166.47573, "text": "It's like high school all over again."}, {"start": 166.57573000000002, "end": 170.89572, "text": "Psycho Brita, the walking freak show for every Barbie with a Cosmo subscription."}, {"start": 171.21573, "end": 173.38201764044945, "text": "Look, I don't mean to be a tool, but you"}, {"start": 173.38201764044945, "end": 176.03572, "text": "embarrassed me that night, too, so call it karma."}, {"start": 176.03572, "end": 180.35573000000002, "text": "Well, boy, I hope I'm not around when you do mean to be a tool."}, {"start": 180.77573, "end": 184.29573000000002, "text": "Let's just put this behind us and just walk to class, okay?"}, {"start": 184.81572, "end": 185.11573, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 185.57573000000002, "end": 185.97573, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 189.33573, "end": 190.27573, "text": "You're Britta Perry?"}, {"start": 190.73574000000002, "end": 192.17572, "text": "Yeah, what's it to you?"}, {"start": 192.45572, "end": 193.93572, "text": "You're the coolest."}, {"start": 194.87572, "end": 195.47573, "text": "Right."}, {"start": 195.93572, "end": 197.97573, "text": "Um, at what exactly?"}, {"start": 198.35573000000002, "end": 201.49573, "text": "Being fearless, honest, speaking from your heart."}, {"start": 202.25573, "end": 204.31572, "text": "Jeff Winger, I love you."}, {"start": 204.31572, "end": 207.81572, "text": "Right, um, my heart may have overstated, but..."}, {"start": 207.81572, "end": 208.67935636363637, "text": "Did you sign stuff?"}, {"start": 208.67935636363637, "end": 209.31572, "text": "Now and again."}, {"start": 209.31572, "end": 210.31572, "text": "Awesome."}, {"start": 210.31572, "end": 212.31572, "text": "I don't like where that's going."}, {"start": 212.31572, "end": 214.31572, "text": "I know, right?"}, {"start": 214.31572, "end": 215.31572, "text": "Um..."}, {"start": 215.31572, "end": 217.31572, "text": "Look."}, {"start": 218.31572, "end": 219.31572, "text": "Um..."}, {"start": 219.31572, "end": 221.31572, "text": "Annie, do you remember the little talk we had?"}, {"start": 221.31572, "end": 222.81572, "text": "The one about discretion?"}, {"start": 222.81572, "end": 223.81572, "text": "Yeah, it's not that."}, {"start": 223.81572, "end": 226.81572, "text": "Look, um, we agreed that you and I kissing was a mistake."}, {"start": 226.81572, "end": 228.81572, "text": "And if anyone were to find out about it,"}, {"start": 228.81572, "end": 230.86911805825244, "text": "I would be tarred, feathered, and put on one of"}, {"start": 230.86911805825244, "end": 233.31572, "text": "those websites people check when they're buying a house."}, {"start": 233.31572, "end": 234.58586925373135, "text": "What's forgotten, Jeff?"}, {"start": 234.58586925373135, "end": 237.01572000000002, "text": "Geez, I'm not some love-struck teeny-bopper."}, {"start": 237.43572, "end": 239.87572, "text": "But you should know, we didn't just kiss, we technically frenched."}, {"start": 239.91573000000002, "end": 242.95572, "text": "I checked the make-out meter in this month's issue of..."}, {"start": 242.95572, "end": 243.93572, "text": "National Review."}, {"start": 249.19573000000003, "end": 250.67572, "text": "I don't like where that's going."}, {"start": 263.31572, "end": 265.81572, "text": "I'm tired of bedding again."}, {"start": 266.13573, "end": 270.07573, "text": "I can't count the reasons I should stay."}, {"start": 270.89574, "end": 274.81572, "text": "One by one, they all just fade away."}, {"start": 280.6157, "end": 281.6757, "text": "Senor Chang."}, {"start": 282.6157, "end": 283.07020675, "text": "Oh, wait."}, {"start": 283.07020675, "end": 284.63573, "text": "I guess it's not senor anymore."}, {"start": 284.7957, "end": 286.03361368421054, "text": "What should we call you?"}, {"start": 286.03361368421054, "end": 286.75573, "text": "Student Chang?"}, {"start": 286.93572, "end": 288.45574, "text": "Two credits into a music major, Chang?"}, {"start": 288.59572000000003, "end": 289.99572, "text": "Okay, how about not calling me anything?"}, {"start": 289.99572, "end": 290.2897740540541, "text": "Hmm?"}, {"start": 290.2897740540541, "end": 292.71572000000003, "text": "Where are you guys in this class?"}, {"start": 292.71575, "end": 296.9349971495327, "text": "Oh we chose it together The real question is why are you in"}, {"start": 296.9349971495327, "end": 301.5833202803738, "text": "it Oh you missed us Oh don flatter yourself okay have you checked"}, {"start": 301.5833202803738, "end": 308.01946000000004, "text": "out the court description ancient weaponry genital mutilation subject talking much anguish"}, {"start": 308.01946000000004, "end": 314.70145133333335, "text": "i don't get it well starburns has grown"}, {"start": 314.70145133333335, "end": 318.89568589333334, "text": "reliant on a star-shaped"}, {"start": 318.89568589333334, "end": 323.43944, "text": "sideburns but still craves"}, {"start": 323.43944, "end": 325.25945, "text": "identity beyond them, so he added a hat."}, {"start": 325.53945, "end": 326.77947, "text": "No, what's up with Britta-mania?"}, {"start": 327.17946, "end": 328.57946000000004, "text": "Oh, that's even simpler."}, {"start": 329.17946, "end": 331.41945, "text": "In the eyes of the public, Britta put herself out there, and you"}, {"start": 331.41945, "end": 333.67946, "text": "walked away, making her the underdog, the Jill T.,"}, {"start": 333.67946, "end": 334.271452, "text": "the Aniston."}, {"start": 334.271452, "end": 335.15944, "text": "That's ridiculous."}, {"start": 335.55947000000003, "end": 335.8497893548387, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 335.8497893548387, "end": 337.35945000000004, "text": "Hey, Jeff, do you have any"}, {"start": 337.35945000000004, "end": 338.3773748275862, "text": "hillbilly cousins?"}, {"start": 338.3773748275862, "end": 338.7732344827586, "text": "I wish."}, {"start": 338.7732344827586, "end": 338.99944, "text": "Why?"}, {"start": 339.13945, "end": 340.19052142857146, "text": "What about a wealthy uncle?"}, {"start": 340.19052142857146, "end": 341.31945, "text": "Or an old drinking buddy that"}, {"start": 341.31945, "end": 342.55947000000003, "text": "may or may not have had a sex change?"}, {"start": 342.69945, "end": 345.43944, "text": "Why are you minding my life with classic sitcom scenarios?"}, {"start": 345.57946000000004, "end": 347.37944, "text": "I guess I'm just excited about the new year, looking for ways"}, {"start": 347.37944, "end": 347.97944, "text": "to improve things."}, {"start": 347.97944, "end": 349.37944, "text": "I'm hoping we can move away from the soapy"}, {"start": 349.37944, "end": 351.27947, "text": "relationship-y stuff and into bigger, fast-paced,"}, {"start": 351.35945000000004, "end": 352.55947000000003, "text": "self-contained escapades."}, {"start": 352.55947000000003, "end": 356.95946000000004, "text": "What is it exactly that separates man from animal?"}, {"start": 357.75945, "end": 358.39946000000003, "text": "Divorce."}, {"start": 366.43944, "end": 371.73946, "text": "Tools, like this blowgun I use to hunt monkeys with a Karubo in the Amazon."}, {"start": 375.71446000000003, "end": 377.65446000000003, "text": "My name is Professor June Bauer,"}, {"start": 377.93446, "end": 381.93446, "text": "and this semester I will guide you to the very threshold of your humanity,"}, {"start": 381.93446, "end": 385.04494633663364, "text": "where you will lock eyes with the shrieking,"}, {"start": 385.04494633663364, "end": 389.07444, "text": "blood-drenched, sister-raping beast from which we sprang."}, {"start": 389.93446, "end": 392.05445, "text": "You will also have to make a diorama."}, {"start": 392.87446, "end": 397.91447, "text": "For your first assignment, I would like you to form tribes of no more than eight,"}, {"start": 398.09446, "end": 400.51846, "text": "and if you can, mix up the races, or"}, {"start": 400.51846, "end": 404.15446000000003, "text": "you'll be surprised at how quickly things get awkward."}, {"start": 407.17445, "end": 409.83445, "text": "You know, now that Troy's off the streets and living with me,"}, {"start": 409.83445, "end": 411.83445, "text": "He's learning so much about the world."}, {"start": 411.83445, "end": 412.12291153846155, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 412.12291153846155, "end": 414.83445, "text": "Tell me again why Jewish people wear yarmulkes?"}, {"start": 414.83445, "end": 415.79097173913044, "text": "Half a hat."}, {"start": 415.79097173913044, "end": 416.83445, "text": "Saves money."}, {"start": 417.83445, "end": 418.83445, "text": "Thank you!"}, {"start": 419.83445, "end": 420.8657, "text": "Half a hat?"}, {"start": 420.8657, "end": 422.83445, "text": "That is so offensive."}, {"start": 422.83445, "end": 424.83445, "text": "I love what white man says."}, {"start": 425.83445, "end": 427.83445, "text": "Hey, find an eighth dork for you shrabbit dorks."}, {"start": 427.83445, "end": 430.825902991453, "text": "Chang, I'm starting to think you took anthropology because you want to"}, {"start": 430.825902991453, "end": 432.83445, "text": "be in our study group but are too proud to ask."}, {"start": 432.83445, "end": 433.83445, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 433.83445, "end": 434.83445, "text": "Keep dreaming, winger."}, {"start": 434.83445, "end": 437.83445, "text": "Would somebody with too much pride do this?"}, {"start": 437.83445, "end": 438.19444, "text": "This?"}, {"start": 438.83445, "end": 441.85447, "text": "Current balance, $23.20."}, {"start": 442.35447, "end": 444.63444, "text": "Consider yourself chained."}, {"start": 446.41447, "end": 450.3295630851064, "text": "Mac and cheese please Sorry Looks like your food just"}, {"start": 450.3295630851064, "end": 453.35822, "text": "walked out on you Same way you did Britta"}, {"start": 459.6782, "end": 461.53822, "text": "Hey, can we talk?"}, {"start": 461.85822, "end": 463.19822, "text": "Oh, now he wants to talk."}, {"start": 463.51823, "end": 464.13822, "text": "No, it's fine."}, {"start": 464.2382, "end": 464.81822, "text": "I'll be right back."}, {"start": 467.2182, "end": 470.35822, "text": "Man, I've got some real passionate fans."}, {"start": 470.57823, "end": 471.3782, "text": "It'll blow over."}, {"start": 471.7182, "end": 474.13822, "text": "Would you mind helping it blow over?"}, {"start": 474.6782, "end": 476.81822, "text": "My stock is kind of plummeting around here."}, {"start": 477.2182, "end": 477.6782, "text": "Oh."}, {"start": 478.47822, "end": 481.1782, "text": "I don't mean to sound like a tool, but maybe it's karma."}, {"start": 481.6782, "end": 484.1582, "text": "Britta, I know you're excited to finally be popular with women,"}, {"start": 484.35822, "end": 485.85822, "text": "but don't get too high on your own drama."}, {"start": 487.2382, "end": 489.7982, "text": "High on my own drama?"}, {"start": 492.8982, "end": 493.85822, "text": "People's champion!"}, {"start": 495.4382, "end": 496.1182, "text": "Starman."}, {"start": 496.6582, "end": 497.9382, "text": "I kind of know what a heat is."}, {"start": 498.5982, "end": 500.0982, "text": "Jeff Wingate, you're a jerk!"}, {"start": 500.0982, "end": 503.9382, "text": "I'm sure that every woman on campus"}, {"start": 503.9382, "end": 504.6582, "text": "gets me."}, {"start": 504.79823, "end": 505.95823, "text": "Well, not every woman."}, {"start": 506.0982, "end": 506.81822, "text": "Certainly not the one"}, {"start": 506.81822, "end": 507.85822, "text": "that deserves to be with you."}, {"start": 508.07823, "end": 510.07823, "text": "Annie, all women deserve to be with me."}, {"start": 510.25822, "end": 510.9982, "text": "And vice versa."}, {"start": 511.1782, "end": 512.19822, "text": "Granted, but who doesn't"}, {"start": 512.19822, "end": 513.0982, "text": "eventually settle down?"}, {"start": 513.2982, "end": 514.7782, "text": "I don't, and I never will."}, {"start": 515.13822, "end": 515.81822, "text": "And if I did..."}, {"start": 516.4982, "end": 519.8182, "text": "If I did..."}, {"start": 521.7382, "end": 523.7982, "text": "I could beat Britta at her own game."}, {"start": 525.4582, "end": 526.39823, "text": "Oh, Britta."}, {"start": 526.9382, "end": 528.4182, "text": "Yeah, you better take a hike."}, {"start": 528.4182, "end": 531.1382, "text": "Do you know where the cleanest bathroom is?"}, {"start": 532.8182, "end": 533.5382, "text": "Teacher's lounge."}, {"start": 533.6382, "end": 533.9582, "text": "Thank you."}, {"start": 535.4582, "end": 536.3199291428572, "text": "Don't be shy."}, {"start": 536.3199291428572, "end": 537.0490845714286, "text": "Come on up."}, {"start": 537.0490845714286, "end": 537.77824, "text": "Have a sip."}, {"start": 538.27824, "end": 541.5182, "text": "The yogi of India swear by its restorative powers."}, {"start": 542.9382, "end": 543.4582, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 544.5582, "end": 546.2582, "text": "More of my urine for me."}, {"start": 547.3182, "end": 549.0782, "text": "Now for your tribe's assignment."}, {"start": 549.77824, "end": 553.1182, "text": "This box contains nine different tools,"}, {"start": 553.1182, "end": 556.3182, "text": "all of them important to humanity's survival."}, {"start": 556.3182, "end": 559.6982, "text": "One of them is the most important of all."}, {"start": 560.2982, "end": 566.5382, "text": "Your tribe's assignment for tomorrow is to tell me which tool that is."}, {"start": 566.6582, "end": 567.1182, "text": "Questions?"}, {"start": 567.5382, "end": 570.1782, "text": "I have a question, but not for you."}, {"start": 571.1782, "end": 571.9382, "text": "It's for Britta."}, {"start": 574.6982, "end": 578.2982, "text": "Britta, I love you."}, {"start": 578.2982, "end": 578.6382, "text": "Oh!"}, {"start": 578.6382, "end": 579.4782, "text": "Oh!"}, {"start": 582.8582, "end": 586.5582, "text": "Now I know this puts you in an awkwardly powerful position,"}, {"start": 586.5582, "end": 589.7582, "text": "but I have to know right now, in front of everyone,"}, {"start": 589.7582, "end": 590.7782, "text": "do you love me too?"}, {"start": 590.7782, "end": 591.6182, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 594.8782, "end": 599.9782, "text": "More than anything in the world."}, {"start": 600.0, "end": 600.65999997, "text": "Really?"}, {"start": 601.16, "end": 601.66, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 602.3799999, "end": 605.52, "text": "So, it begins."}, {"start": 607.98, "end": 610.66, "text": "The greatest relationship ever known."}, {"start": 621.3, "end": 623.68, "text": "This is making me sick."}, {"start": 623.68, "end": 623.8, "text": "Thank you."}, {"start": 628.279999, "end": 629.599998, "text": "I'm gonna love you forever."}, {"start": 630.0, "end": 631.2, "text": "Good, I'm gonna love you forever."}, {"start": 631.86, "end": 632.74, "text": "I don't believe you."}, {"start": 633.4, "end": 633.6528, "text": "Why?"}, {"start": 633.6528, "end": 634.98, "text": "Don't you want me to?"}, {"start": 635.38, "end": 635.89, "text": "No, I do."}, {"start": 635.89, "end": 636.4, "text": "Bring it."}, {"start": 638.74, "end": 640.3, "text": "Doesn't it make you want to cry?"}, {"start": 640.92, "end": 641.9733333333334, "text": "Something like that."}, {"start": 641.9733333333334, "end": 642.5, "text": "Excuse me."}, {"start": 643.26, "end": 645.26, "text": "I downloaded a song that makes me think of you."}, {"start": 645.9, "end": 648.14, "text": "Let's listen to it, each using one earbud."}, {"start": 651.663, "end": 653.083, "text": "Shirley, would you consider spinning off with me?"}, {"start": 653.563, "end": 655.223, "text": "Just riffing, but we could open a hair salon together."}, {"start": 655.8629999999999, "end": 657.0088333333333, "text": "Well, I don't understand."}, {"start": 657.0088333333333, "end": 658.063, "text": "Is this you being meta?"}, {"start": 658.443, "end": 660.683, "text": "I wanted to come out of the gate having adventures, like paintball."}, {"start": 661.1229979999999, "end": 661.823, "text": "This is boring."}, {"start": 661.823, "end": 663.483, "text": "Well, I think that's selfish, Abed."}, {"start": 663.483, "end": 665.1229979999999, "text": "If you were a friend to Jeff and Britta,"}, {"start": 665.1229979999999, "end": 668.323, "text": "you would see their relationship as an adventure."}, {"start": 668.323, "end": 669.6229999999999, "text": "I hadn't thought about it that way."}, {"start": 669.6229999999999, "end": 671.6229999999999, "text": "Oh, look at how they walk!"}, {"start": 671.6229999999999, "end": 673.6229999999999, "text": "How can you be both at home?"}, {"start": 673.6229999999999, "end": 677.2945779999999, "text": "Ooh Clearly the most important tool to a tribe survival is"}, {"start": 677.2945779999999, "end": 681.0927621379309, "text": "here the cross representing Christianity It an axe It an axe"}, {"start": 681.0927621379309, "end": 684.6377339999999, "text": "Maybe it the telescope You can look through it backwards"}, {"start": 684.6377339999999, "end": 685.6377339999999, "text": "Shrink your enemies."}, {"start": 685.6377339999999, "end": 688.6377339999999, "text": "I'll show you the tool that's most important to our survival."}, {"start": 688.6377339999999, "end": 691.6377339999999, "text": "But fair warning, it's my penis."}, {"start": 699.6377339999999, "end": 700.6377339999999, "text": "Sorry I'm late."}, {"start": 700.6377339999999, "end": 702.6377339999999, "text": "I was in my car loving Britta."}, {"start": 704.6377339999999, "end": 708.69773, "text": "I guess I just love you too much."}, {"start": 708.8977299999999, "end": 710.1177299999999, "text": "Not half as much as me."}, {"start": 711.2577299999999, "end": 712.43774, "text": "Jeff, do you think you'll marry Britta?"}, {"start": 713.1377339999999, "end": 714.65774, "text": "I'd like to see someone stop me."}, {"start": 714.95773, "end": 716.2377299999999, "text": "I just peed a little."}, {"start": 717.7577299999999, "end": 718.45773, "text": "Then here, propose."}, {"start": 723.717736, "end": 725.91773, "text": "I got it, I got it, I got it, I got it."}, {"start": 725.9977339999999, "end": 728.93774, "text": "Jeff Winger, will you marry me?"}, {"start": 729.19773, "end": 730.19773, "text": "Yeah, yeah, of course."}, {"start": 730.19773, "end": 732.15774, "text": "No comment."}, {"start": 732.9177299999999, "end": 733.93774, "text": "Perfect, I'll be right back."}, {"start": 733.93774, "end": 736.43774, "text": "Oh!"}, {"start": 736.43774, "end": 738.17774, "text": "Thank the Lord you're getting married."}, {"start": 738.17774, "end": 740.07774, "text": "I was so worried about your souls ever since you had"}, {"start": 740.07774, "end": 741.57774, "text": "premarital sex on the table."}, {"start": 741.57774, "end": 743.47773, "text": "Oh!"}, {"start": 743.47773, "end": 744.87772, "text": "Oh!"}, {"start": 744.87772, "end": 745.77773, "text": "Oh!"}, {"start": 745.77773, "end": 746.8577399999999, "text": "Awesome!"}, {"start": 746.8577399999999, "end": 747.87772, "text": "You told Shirley?"}, {"start": 747.87772, "end": 749.79774, "text": "Well, there's no need for secrecy now."}, {"start": 749.79774, "end": 750.87772, "text": "It was during the paintball game."}, {"start": 750.87772, "end": 757.515095, "text": "Was there anything you didn win that day Oh my god You"}, {"start": 757.515095, "end": 764.15247, "text": "slept with her and then kissed me What What In so deep"}, {"start": 767.9104699999999, "end": 771.7904599999999, "text": "You know she's such a fool for him"}, {"start": 771.7904599999999, "end": 775.4904599999999, "text": "She has a ring around her finger"}, {"start": 775.4904599999999, "end": 780.0304699999999, "text": "And I'll bet hired an Irish singer"}, {"start": 780.0304699999999, "end": 784.3704699999998, "text": "For it is Marianne, for it is Marianne, for it is Marianne Duffery Winker"}, {"start": 784.3704699999998, "end": 786.5104599999999, "text": "What the hell is this?"}, {"start": 786.7104599999999, "end": 788.1304799999999, "text": "A wedding episode."}, {"start": 788.4504699999999, "end": 789.6504599999998, "text": "Abed, there's no wedding."}, {"start": 789.9704699999999, "end": 790.4083993103446, "text": "Cold feet?"}, {"start": 790.4083993103446, "end": 792.5104599999999, "text": "Talking over with your best man, George Clooney."}, {"start": 792.9704699999999, "end": 793.4704699999999, "text": "What's up?"}, {"start": 793.75047, "end": 796.1104699999999, "text": "He's a George Clooney impersonator, but still razzle-dazzle, right?"}, {"start": 796.6904699999999, "end": 797.0904699999999, "text": "Abed?"}, {"start": 800.0824600000001, "end": 800.96247, "text": "Jeff made out with Annie."}, {"start": 801.16246, "end": 801.3224700000001, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 801.62247, "end": 801.9315563636363, "text": "When?"}, {"start": 801.9315563636363, "end": 802.30246, "text": "Where?"}, {"start": 802.46247, "end": 803.02247, "text": "Yeah, where?"}, {"start": 803.30246, "end": 804.1782091489362, "text": "That's inappropriate."}, {"start": 804.1782091489362, "end": 805.26247, "text": "I'm assuming on the mount."}, {"start": 805.90247, "end": 807.40247, "text": "It was after the transfer dance."}, {"start": 807.40247, "end": 809.52247, "text": "Oh, so I tell you that I love you,"}, {"start": 809.66246, "end": 812.60247, "text": "and then you go outside and stick your tongue into a teenager."}, {"start": 812.7224600000001, "end": 814.24247, "text": "What is wrong with you, Jeff?"}, {"start": 814.24247, "end": 817.8073852542373, "text": "Well, Shirley, since you have clearly failed to grasp the"}, {"start": 817.8073852542373, "end": 821.62247, "text": "central, insipid metaphor of those Twilight books you devour,"}, {"start": 821.90247, "end": 822.96247, "text": "let me explain it to you."}, {"start": 823.26246, "end": 825.60247, "text": "Men are monsters who crave young flesh."}, {"start": 825.92246, "end": 826.38247, "text": "The end."}, {"start": 826.60247, "end": 829.22248, "text": "At least we have the decency to be ashamed of it and keep it a secret"}, {"start": 829.22248, "end": 832.9824600000001, "text": "instead of publicly blurting I love you to everyone who sleeps with us."}, {"start": 833.0024800000001, "end": 834.7224600000001, "text": "Oh, please, I never loved you."}, {"start": 834.92246, "end": 839.20029015625, "text": "Ah I win I win I win in your face So this was all"}, {"start": 839.20029015625, "end": 846.0972, "text": "a game Everything they do is some sick competition Oh like you hate competition"}, {"start": 846.4572000000001, "end": 849.33721, "text": "How long did it take you to kiss Jeff after I told him that I loved him?"}, {"start": 849.5172, "end": 850.6987, "text": "Oh, that's right."}, {"start": 850.6987, "end": 852.2972, "text": "First Vaughn, now Jeff."}, {"start": 852.4372000000001, "end": 855.9372000000001, "text": "I better not smile at that wall outlet or you'll fry your tongue off."}, {"start": 856.1772000000001, "end": 857.4572000000001, "text": "Way to hog all the girls, Jeff."}, {"start": 857.7172, "end": 859.8218511627907, "text": "You know, when there's three sprinkled donuts, you"}, {"start": 859.8218511627907, "end": 861.3372, "text": "don't eat one and then lick another."}, {"start": 861.3372, "end": 863.3968450909091, "text": "Anyone object to us being referred to as donuts?"}, {"start": 863.3968450909091, "end": 863.69721, "text": "No one?"}, {"start": 863.69721, "end": 866.3593327659576, "text": "I'm sorry we can't all be as honorable as you,"}, {"start": 866.3593327659576, "end": 869.1372000000001, "text": "Troy, and post Pierce quotes all day on Twitter."}, {"start": 869.4972, "end": 869.7436864864865, "text": "Wow."}, {"start": 869.7436864864865, "end": 873.5026054054053, "text": "Is that your lame attempt to try and pass the hot seat to me?"}, {"start": 873.5026054054053, "end": 874.0572, "text": "Nice try."}, {"start": 874.0972, "end": 874.4411024390245, "text": "Wait."}, {"start": 874.4411024390245, "end": 876.0230536585367, "text": "I'm old white man says?"}, {"start": 876.0230536585367, "end": 878.9118341463416, "text": "No wonder he says everything I'm thinking."}, {"start": 878.9118341463416, "end": 879.7372, "text": "You bastard."}, {"start": 881.3572, "end": 883.3172, "text": "I'm just sharing what you say."}, {"start": 883.4372000000001, "end": 886.1896752475247, "text": "Yeah, well, what if I share all the stuff you say?"}, {"start": 886.1896752475247, "end": 888.9972, "text": "He thinks all dogs are boys and all cats are girls."}, {"start": 889.1372000000001, "end": 890.6102158730159, "text": "There's no way to disprove that."}, {"start": 890.6102158730159, "end": 892.0372, "text": "Have you ever seen a cat penis?"}, {"start": 892.4972, "end": 893.3172, "text": "Where are you going?"}, {"start": 893.6972000000001, "end": 897.1022681355932, "text": "By the power vested in me, I now pronounce you..."}, {"start": 897.1022681355932, "end": 897.79718, "text": "cancelled."}, {"start": 897.79718, "end": 899.4553267441861, "text": "Oh good, yeah, Abed, cancel us."}, {"start": 899.4553267441861, "end": 902.3972000000001, "text": "And while you're at it, why don't you take your cutesy,"}, {"start": 902.3972000000001, "end": 904.8377405405406, "text": "I can't tell life from TV gimmick with you."}, {"start": 904.8377405405406, "end": 906.5972, "text": "You know, it's very season one."}, {"start": 906.5972, "end": 908.3419447368422, "text": "I can tell life from TV, Jeff."}, {"start": 908.3419447368422, "end": 909.2143171052633, "text": "TV makes sense."}, {"start": 909.2143171052633, "end": 911.0172200000001, "text": "It has structure, logic, rules,"}, {"start": 916.52722, "end": 918.4792093333334, "text": "and likable leading men."}, {"start": 918.4792093333334, "end": 920.1872000000001, "text": "In life we have this."}, {"start": 920.1872000000001, "end": 922.30718, "text": "We have you."}, {"start": 925.866, "end": 929.54599985, "text": "I'm on the clock for another hour if"}, {"start": 929.54599985, "end": 933.2259997, "text": "you want me to do some Batman lines."}, {"start": 933.2259997, "end": 939.6017892447368, "text": "not sitting with your"}, {"start": 939.6017892447368, "end": 944.7631426857142, "text": "little group your"}, {"start": 944.7631426857142, "end": 949.9933141725713, "text": "group's done yeah"}, {"start": 949.9933141725713, "end": 954.608171366857, "text": "well missionary"}, {"start": 954.608171366857, "end": 960.146, "text": "accomplished right"}, {"start": 960.146, "end": 961.4259979999999, "text": "What does that mean?"}, {"start": 961.765998, "end": 962.2459984324324, "text": "Come on."}, {"start": 962.2459984324324, "end": 963.986, "text": "I know you and Britta did it."}, {"start": 964.786, "end": 967.065997, "text": "Isn't the whole reason you got together with those people"}, {"start": 967.065997, "end": 968.786, "text": "because you wanted to bang the blonde?"}, {"start": 969.405997, "end": 971.765998, "text": "And now I hear that you frenched the brunette?"}, {"start": 972.225997, "end": 974.385997, "text": "What more could you have gotten out of that group?"}, {"start": 976.126, "end": 977.346, "text": "Good morning, class."}, {"start": 978.105998, "end": 980.986, "text": "Let's dive in and hear the results of your assignment."}, {"start": 981.745997, "end": 982.806, "text": "Who wants to go first?"}, {"start": 984.245997, "end": 985.223499125, "text": "I don't know, Mr."}, {"start": 985.223499125, "end": 985.626, "text": "Winger."}, {"start": 985.6659999999999, "end": 987.1659999999999, "text": "The last time I called on you,"}, {"start": 987.1659999999999, "end": 990.786, "text": "I kind of got what the mako mako called dirt roaded."}, {"start": 991.046, "end": 992.306, "text": "Using it."}, {"start": 992.886, "end": 994.366, "text": "Yeah, I'm sorry about that."}, {"start": 996.266, "end": 997.946, "text": "It was a trick question."}, {"start": 998.706, "end": 1001.845996, "text": "The tool most important to humanity's survival"}, {"start": 1001.845996, "end": 1004.246, "text": "wasn't any of the nine in the box."}, {"start": 1005.326, "end": 1005.966, "text": "Go on."}, {"start": 1006.766, "end": 1013.15672, "text": "The most important tool is respect Ha Gay And the reason I know"}, {"start": 1013.15672, "end": 1019.446, "text": "respect is a tool is because it is clearly not a natural thing"}, {"start": 1019.586, "end": 1021.546, "text": "and we forget to use it all the time,"}, {"start": 1021.706, "end": 1023.586, "text": "and then we start competing with each other"}, {"start": 1023.586, "end": 1027.206, "text": "and exploiting each other and humiliating each other"}, {"start": 1027.206, "end": 1030.446, "text": "and controlling each other, and we lose each other."}, {"start": 1031.386004, "end": 1034.886004, "text": "And without each other, we'll go extinct."}, {"start": 1034.886004, "end": 1037.086, "text": "And that's a fact."}, {"start": 1037.646, "end": 1038.706, "text": "Gay fact."}, {"start": 1039.366, "end": 1040.506, "text": "That's my answer, Professor."}, {"start": 1044.7259999999999, "end": 1046.326, "text": "Well, that's one answer."}, {"start": 1047.446, "end": 1049.086, "text": "Here's the one I had in mind."}, {"start": 1049.6259949999999, "end": 1054.366, "text": "Combining all nine tools, you get this."}, {"start": 1055.426, "end": 1058.806, "text": "A deadlier weapon than any one item in the box."}, {"start": 1059.566, "end": 1062.806, "text": "So, I'm going to use this to attack you."}, {"start": 1062.806, "end": 1066.246, "text": "and you use respect to defend yourself."}, {"start": 1066.246, "end": 1068.246, "text": "Uh, oh, uh..."}, {"start": 1068.246, "end": 1069.026, "text": "Oh!"}, {"start": 1071.026, "end": 1073.426, "text": "Oh, my God!"}, {"start": 1073.526, "end": 1076.806, "text": "I respect you."}, {"start": 1077.32599, "end": 1079.066, "text": "That's why you fail."}, {"start": 1081.686, "end": 1083.226, "text": "Oh, my God!"}, {"start": 1084.446, "end": 1085.686, "text": "Pass it out!"}, {"start": 1087.226, "end": 1092.686, "text": "Oh, thank God."}, {"start": 1092.806, "end": 1097.3926666666666, "text": "What happened Professor Bauer got suspended and we got an automatic A on our"}, {"start": 1097.3926666666666, "end": 1101.9793333333332, "text": "assignment Did someone throw urine in my face Oh sometimes I surprise myself"}, {"start": 1101.9793333333332, "end": 1106.566, "text": "under pressure Jeff about the assignment we decided you had the right answer"}, {"start": 1106.886, "end": 1109.446, "text": "I think we need a little more respect and a little less passion."}, {"start": 1109.786, "end": 1112.526, "text": "Which will be easy for me because I think you're kind of gross now."}, {"start": 1113.226, "end": 1113.666, "text": "Awesome."}, {"start": 1114.62601, "end": 1116.12601, "text": "Pierce, I'm going to delete that Twitter account."}, {"start": 1116.606, "end": 1118.766, "text": "Your friendship is more important than 600,000 strangers."}, {"start": 1118.766, "end": 1119.846, "text": "Whoa, whoa, whoa."}, {"start": 1119.846, "end": 1122.9859999999999, "text": "Are you saying 600,000 people read what I say on Twitter?"}, {"start": 1123.686, "end": 1125.286, "text": "Well, we're going to cash in on that."}, {"start": 1125.886, "end": 1129.086, "text": "How about old white man says it's a TV show?"}, {"start": 1129.706, "end": 1130.066, "text": "No."}, {"start": 1131.426, "end": 1134.106, "text": "Speaking of bad development strategy, I owe you all an apology."}, {"start": 1134.5059999999999, "end": 1136.106, "text": "I was trying so hard to make our first week a great one."}, {"start": 1136.246, "end": 1138.12601, "text": "I didn't realize there was something great in front of us the whole time."}, {"start": 1138.546, "end": 1139.686, "text": "An old woman drinking her own pee."}, {"start": 1140.646, "end": 1140.966, "text": "Right."}, {"start": 1141.12601, "end": 1141.266, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 1142.40601, "end": 1145.666, "text": "Guys, I got a confession to make."}, {"start": 1145.746, "end": 1148.266, "text": "I took anthropology because I want to be a part of your study group."}, {"start": 1148.546, "end": 1149.026, "text": "Oh."}, {"start": 1149.846, "end": 1153.306, "text": "Now, I gotta do the honest thing and just ask."}, {"start": 1153.90601, "end": 1157.146, "text": "Is there any room in this pocket for a little spare Chang?"}, {"start": 1158.926, "end": 1161.966, "text": "Uh, look, we've been through a lot today."}, {"start": 1162.866, "end": 1165.12601, "text": "Um, give us a little time to think it over."}, {"start": 1165.446, "end": 1166.926, "text": "Totally, totally, man."}, {"start": 1166.9859999999999, "end": 1170.146, "text": "Just think about it, take your time, and, um, let me know."}, {"start": 1170.16599, "end": 1170.446, "text": "Bye."}, {"start": 1170.706, "end": 1171.086, "text": "See ya."}, {"start": 1173.206, "end": 1174.866, "text": "Aw, poor guy."}, {"start": 1175.226, "end": 1176.32599, "text": "Oh, we'll let him in eventually."}, {"start": 1176.60599, "end": 1177.16599, "text": "Says who?"}, {"start": 1177.526, "end": 1181.8764838709678, "text": "Look we have the strength to survive anything"}, {"start": 1181.8764838709678, "end": 1185.2601935483872, "text": "What the worst that can happen with"}, {"start": 1185.2601935483872, "end": 1191.275677419355, "text": "Chang That true Yeah That a with Chang I told you they hate you"}, {"start": 1191.275677419355, "end": 1198.246, "text": "no they said they just needed more time time they destroyed your life how"}, {"start": 1198.246, "end": 1205.026, "text": "much time before we take revenge but they're my friends I'm your only friend"}, {"start": 1205.026, "end": 1205.866, "text": "No."}, {"start": 1206.466, "end": 1207.186, "text": "Ha ha ha!"}, {"start": 1207.50598, "end": 1207.84598, "text": "No!"}, {"start": 1208.206, "end": 1209.366, "text": "Ha ha ha ha!"}, {"start": 1209.546, "end": 1210.026, "text": "No!"}, {"start": 1219.126, "end": 1220.666, "text": "Kingdom Animalia."}, {"start": 1220.886, "end": 1221.84598, "text": "Phylum, poor daughter."}, {"start": 1222.086, "end": 1222.806, "text": "The class is..."}, {"start": 1222.806, "end": 1223.326, "text": "Momalia."}, {"start": 1223.40598, "end": 1224.50598, "text": "Cause boobies, we gotta."}, {"start": 1224.826, "end": 1226.0659799999999, "text": "Order is primate."}, {"start": 1226.106, "end": 1227.206, "text": "Family, hominity."}, {"start": 1227.366, "end": 1228.246, "text": "The genus is..."}, {"start": 1228.246, "end": 1228.526, "text": "Homo."}, {"start": 1228.526, "end": 1229.90598, "text": "But you know you're into me."}, {"start": 1229.966, "end": 1232.446, "text": "Cause I am in a species known as sapien."}, {"start": 1232.586, "end": 1233.686, "text": "Dogs used to eat me."}, {"start": 1233.686, "end": 1235.186, "text": "But now they bring the paper in."}, {"start": 1235.4859999999999, "end": 1239.5659799999999, "text": "It's gonna take a lot to get me away from you."}, {"start": 1239.646, "end": 1240.606, "text": "Damn, damn."}, {"start": 1240.606, "end": 1244.806, "text": "There's nothing that a hundred men or more could ever do."}, {"start": 1245.0659799999999, "end": 1245.666, "text": "Sapien."}, {"start": 1246.126, "end": 1249.606, "text": "I bless the rains down in Africa."}, {"start": 1249.96598, "end": 1252.0659799999999, "text": "Oh, bless the rains."}, {"start": 1252.086, "end": 1254.78598, "text": "I bless the rains down in Africa."}, {"start": 1255.96598, "end": 1260.106, "text": "I bless the rains down in Africa."}, {"start": 1260.106, "end": 1260.206, "text": "Africa."}, {"start": 1260.5659799999999, "end": 1261.246, "text": "Africa."}]}